  L("Clojure","Immutable persistent collections by default; explicit mutable refs (atom/ref/agent).","Hickey's argument that identity and state should be separated, on top of the JVM.","Data processing, concurrent systems.","JVM startup; dynamic typing; unfamiliar syntax."),
